!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/

# Never send these, even if they appear inside an allowed path.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
htmlcov/
scratchpad/
state/
